{"id":"000VO1","title":"VEGAS #1","author":"lgastako","solvedCount":15,"difficulty":1,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-22T22:24:47+00:00","posted":"Gestern, 22:36 Uhr","rules":"Here is my latest puzzle. It is the first installment in a new series I'm creating called VEGAS which stands for Very Easy Genuinely Approachable Sudoku.\n\nPeople seem to really enjoy some of my easy puzzles so I thought people might enjoy a series that consists entirely of these light snacks. If you're looking for a challenge, this ain't it :)\n\nFeel free to check out some of my other puzzles, or the puzzles of my friend starchacer.\n\nI hope you enjoy. As always, feedback is welcome and encouraged.\n\n• Normal Sudoku Rules: Fill each row, column, and 3x3 box with the digits 1-9 once each.\n\n• Modular Lines: Any set of three consecutive cells along a teal modular line must contain one digit from each modular set: {1, 4, 7}, {2, 5, 8}, and {3, 6, 9}.\n\n• Killer Cages: Digits in cages must not repeat and must sum to the number in the upper left corner of the cage (if present).\n\nPlay online at Solve Paths\n\nPlay online using Sudokupad","solutionCode":"Column 3 from top to bottom.","tags":["Sudoku","Killer (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/aq6y8d27iv","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/aq6y8d27iv","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":18,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-22T22:24:47+00:00"}